---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "My Approach | AOC, Calgary";
const description = "Learn about the collaborative, curious and transparent approach being developed at AOC.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
<main id="main"><div class="wrap"><section class="page-head"><div class="eyebrow">My approach</div><h1>Curiosity first.<br>Change, together.</h1><p class="lead">The AOC approach is being shaped around collaboration, clear communication, and respect for your experience.</p></section><div class="content-grid"><div class="prose steps"><div class="step"><div class="eyebrow">01 / Understand</div><h3>Make room for the whole picture.</h3><p>Your concerns exist within a life, with relationships, culture, strengths, and pressures. Understanding that context helps give the conversation direction.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="eyebrow">02 / Clarify</div><h3>Decide what matters to you.</h3><p>Rather than assuming what progress should look like, identify changes that would make a meaningful difference in your day-to-day life.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="eyebrow">03 / Explore</div><h3>Connect understanding with action.</h3><p>Consider patterns, reflect on possible responses, and discuss manageable next steps that fit your goals and circumstances.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="eyebrow">04 / Review</div><h3>Keep the conversation open.</h3><p>Make space for feedback about what feels useful, what does not, and whether the direction needs to change.</p></div></div><aside class="side-box"><h3>A transparent beginning</h3><p>Before counselling starts, you should understand the approach, fees, privacy arrangements, limits of confidentiality, and whether the service is appropriate for your needs.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Consultation details ↗</a></aside></div></div></main>
</Layout>
